- Improved error messages and guard rails.
  - `getLibrariesIO` now includes HTTP code in the error text; still non-fatal.
  - `getSingleVersion` returns a more descriptive error if no releases are usable.
  - `addWheelDependencies` wraps failures with the failing URL for clarity.
  - All critical steps also emit a debug log entry.

- Non-functional changes only; no logic changes to build behavior beyond added logs.

